, M22759/16 OR EQUIV","color":"White","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"wp_20_red","partNumber":"EW-1C20-RED","manufacturer":"generic","description":"WIRE, ELECTRICAL, 20 AWG, RED, ETFE (TEFZEL) INSULATED, 150 C, M22759/16 OR EQUIV","color":"Red","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}}],"cableParts":[{"id":"cab_sh_2c","url":"https://xonstorage.z8.web.core.windows.net/pdf/teconnectivity_55pc112220593cs3326_xonjuly20_20_nocatlink.pdf","color":"White","cores":[{"id":"k1","color":"Red","gauge":{"unit":"AWG","value":20},"twistedWithNext":true},{"id":"k2","color":"Blue","gauge":{"unit":"AWG","value":20}}],"shielded":true,"partNumber":"55PC1122-20-2/6-9","description":"CABLE, SHIELDED, 2 CONDUCTOR TWISTED PAIR, 20 AWG, FOIL + TINNED COPPER BRAID, JACKETED","manufacturer":"TE Connectivity (Raychem)"},{"id":"cab_sh_4c","url":"https://xonstorage.z8.web.core.windows.net/pdf/teconnectivity_55pc124322mst49cs2861_xonjuly20_20_link.pdf","color":"White","cores":[{"id":"k1","color":"Red","gauge":{"unit":"AWG","value":20},"twistedWithNext":true},{"id":"k2","color":"Blue","gauge":{"unit":"AWG","value":20},"twistedWithNext":true},{"id":"k3","color":"Yellow","gauge":{"unit":"AWG","value":20},"twistedWithNext":true},{"id":"k4","color":"Green","gauge":{"unit":"AWG","value":20}}],"shielded":true,"partNumber":"55PC1243-20-2/6/4/5-9","description":"CABLE, SHIELDED, 4 CONDUCTOR, 20 AWG, FOIL + TINNED COPPER BRAID, JACKETED","manufacturer":"TE Connectivity (Raychem)"}],"spliceParts":[{"id":"spp_solder_generic","partNumber":"GENERIC SOLDER SPLICE","manufacturer":"generic","description":"SPLICE, SOLDERED, ADHESIVE HEATSHRINK OVER"}],"cavityPlugParts":[{"partNumber":"0413-204-2005","manufacturer":"TE DEUTSCH","description":"PLUG, SEALING, CAVITY, SIZE 20, RED","id":"pl_sz20"}],"terminalParts":[{"type":"Loose","partNumber":"GENERIC FLYING LEAD","manufacturer":"generic","minGauge":{"value":22,"unit":"AWG"},"maxGauge":{"value":16,"unit":"AWG"},"description":"TERMINAL, FLYING LEAD","id":"tp_flying_lead"}],"contactParts":[{"partNumber":"0462-201-2031","manufacturer":"TE DEUTSCH","type":"Crimp","gender":"Socket","minGauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"},"maxGauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"},"description":"CONTACT, SOCKET, SOLID, SIZE 20, GOLD, 20 AWG, 7.5 A","id":"ct_hdp20s"}],"schematicNotes":[{"id":"n_csb3","schematicPosition":{"x":0,"y":-300},"text":"ECUMASTER CSB3 HARNESS - the CSB3 plug (HD36-24-33SE) and its switch inputs: cruise stalk, clutch and brake switches, the cruise ladder pull-up. +12V, ground, CAN H and CAN L leave on one 55PC1243-20-2/6/4/5-9 4-core (cab_sh_4c) broken off to ST185-CAN. Two CSB3 shields: the enclosure screen (cab_can_csb3_sh) is grounded at the CSB3 box on Loose ep_csb3_sh (VRC case-ground pattern, no part). The CANbus drop screen (cab_can_csb_sh on ST185-CAN) splices onto the trunk at sp_can_sh and does not land on the box. The reverse input from ST185-B-cabin, the oil LED sink from ST185-ClusterLED and +5V from ST185-A-cabin still arrive broken off. Non-ECU harness."},{"id":"n_cavity_notes","schematicPosition":{"x":4200,"y":0},"text":"CAVITY NOTES - full text of the signals marked * on this drawing\nECUMaster CSB3 - Power/CAN/Swi c26: L4 low-side - oil pressure LED sink (CAN 0x643); the wire from this pin to the LED is drawn on ST185-ClusterLED (broken off)"}],"connectorParts":[{"partNumber":"HD36-24-33SE","manufacturer":"TE DEUTSCH","description":"CONNECTOR, PLUG, HD30, SHELL 24, 33 POS, SOCKET CONTACTS, E SEAL","numberOfCavities":33,"gender":"Female","hasShell":false,"configurations":[{"id":"cfg","contactPartId":"ct_hdp20s","cavityPlugPartId":"pl_sz20"}],"id":"cp_csb3_plug","image":{"source":"url","url":"https://www.te.com/catalog/common/images/PartImages/prhd36-24-33sn.jpg","lowResUrl":"https://www.te.com/catalog/common/images/PartThumbnails/thhd36-24-33sn.jpg"}}],"resistorParts":[{"id":"rp_10k","partNumber":"10k 1/4W","manufacturer":"generic","description":"RESISTOR, FIXED, METAL FILM, 10 KOHM, 5 PCT, 1/4 W"}]}